[size=5][b]Arcane Wilds (ArcaneWilds v1.1.0)[/b][/size]

[b]Arcane Wilds[/b] is a script-driven [b]UE4SS[/b] magic combat overhaul and custom spell framework for [i]RuneScape: Dragonwilds[/i]. It unlocks move-while-casting, adds weighted cross-element and Ancient Magicks combo chaining, provides Block/Modifier Quick-Cast hotkeys with EnhancedInput action suppression, introduces a JSON-schema-validated custom spell timeline engine with crowd control, progression gating, and staff/Magic damage scaling, and fixes vanilla Air finisher aim—all with [b]zero vanilla asset overrides[/b].

[list]
[*][b]Discord:[/b] [url=https://discord.gg/QwktYjdbtx]Join our Discord[/url][/*]
[*][b]Support:[/b] [url=https://ko-fi.com/zolantris]Support on Ko-fi[/url][/*]
[/list]

[line]
Please see the GitHub repo's [url=https://github.com/zolantris/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/blob/main/arcane-wilds/README.md]README[/url] for the latest information. The main GitHub repo can be found [url=https://github.com/zolantris/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/tree/main]here[/url].

[size=4][b]Core Gameplay Features[/b][/size]

[b]Movement Unlock (Freecast) & Vanilla Fixes[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Move-While-Casting (UnlockAir / Fire / Water / Earth)[/b]: Removes movement locks and root-motion anchoring during supported Staff and Wand spell montages, with configurable MaxMoveSpeed (default 600).[/*]
[*][b]Third-Party & Utility Spell Support[/b]: Automatically discovers and unlocks modded combat spells (UnlockModdedCombat=true, e.g., [i]HydraAncientMagicks[/i], [i]Conjurer[/i], [i]Ancient Staff[/i]) and optionally utility spells (UnlockUtilitySpells=false).[/*]
[*][b]4th Air Spell Freedom & Vertical Aim Fix (FixAir4thVerticalAim=true)[/b]:
• Leaves the 4th Air combo unlocked by default (KeepGroundSmashAnchored=false; toggle ON to restore rooted vanilla behavior).
• Runtime-patches DA_Spell_Primary_Air_04 (and Air_Wand_04 if present) so SpellModule_Transform and SpellModule_Movement trigger at cast start (Immediate instead of FinishedCasting), track TracedPlayerCameraForward vertical pitch/rotation like hits 1–3, and raise ground-level spawn offsets to torso height so sloped and elevated shots connect cleanly.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Block / Stance Modifier & Weighted Combo Chains[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Stance-Gated Combos (ModifierKey=RMB)[/b]: Hold Block (RMB / Gamepad LT / LB)—or rebind to SHIFT, ALT, CTRL, MOUSE4, MOUSE5, or MMB—to engage custom combo macros matching your equipped staff/wand and equipped elemental rune (MagicAmmo1) or active Ancient Magicks toggle.[/*]
[*][b]Cross-Element, Custom & Modded Chains (combo_rules.json)[/b]:
• Author weighted single-element, multi-stage cross-element, Ancient Magicks, Conjurer, or custom-spell chains with per-stage speed multipliers and BonusSpeedVariancePct randomization.
• Automatically returns to your original equipped anchor element before rolling a new chain, and resets cleanly when you release Block or swap weapons/runes.
• Validated by schemas/combo_rules.schema.json with ready-to-copy templates in combo_rules_examples.json and friendly aliases in spell_names.txt.[/*]
[*][b]Hold-to-Auto-Attack (EnableAutoAttackHold=true)[/b]: Hold Left-Click (LMB) or Right Trigger (RT) to chain casts continuously when idle—both inside Block/Modifier combos and on standard attacks (AutoAttackAllCombos=true).[/*]
[/list]

[b]Quick-Cast Hotkeys & EnhancedInput Suppression[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Direct Spell & Combo Hotkeys (quick_cast.txt & Mod Menu)[/b]:
• Cast any custom spell, native DA_Spell_* asset, or inline combo chain instantly using keyboard and controller bindings (with Block, Shift, Alt, Ctrl, or None modifiers).
• Ships with 4 default bindings (editable in quick_cast.txt for unlimited slots, or via Slots #1–#4 in Mod Menu / config.txt):
• Block + 1 / GP_X -> [b]Saradomin Godsword[/b]
• Block + 2 / GP_Y -> [b]Flames of Zamorak[/b]
• Block + 3 / GP_B -> [b]Storm of Armadyl[/b]
• Block + 4 / GP_A -> [b]Saradomin Strike[/b][/*]
[*][b]Conflict-Free Input Suppression (QuickCastSuppressGameActions=true)[/b]: Dynamically constructs a high-priority UInputMappingContext and UInputAction at runtime while holding your Quick-Cast modifier so vanilla Hotbar 1–4 and controller face-button actions do not trigger alongside Quick-Cast, restoring normal bindings immediately on release.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Animation Pacing, Special Abilities & Rune Accuracy[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Notify-Safe Speed Clamping (EnableFinisherSpeedClamp=true)[/b]: Drives live speed via Montage_SetPlayRate (keeping RateScale=1.0 so rates are never squared) and clamps delayed/multi-stage finishers (Meteor, Volcano, Air Slam, Boulder, or clamp: true custom spells) to MaxFinisherSpeedClamp (5.0x default) so AnimNotify damage and projectile spawns are never skipped.[/*]
[*][b]Special Ability & Repeat-Animation Pacing[/b]: Supports special energy bar injection/checks (InjectSpecialBarOnSpecials, RequireSpecialEnergyForSpecials), special cast speed capping (MaxSpecialCastRate), post-special cooldown pauses (PostSpecialPauseSec), and repeat-montage padding (AnimRepeatPadSec).[/*]
[*][b]Rune-Accurate Consumption (ConsumeRunesOnSwappedCasts=true)[/b]: Detects equipped staves/wands and MagicAmmo1 runes via PlayerEquipmentComponent / LoadoutComponent hooks and deducts matching runes or spell cost items from inventory on swapped and custom casts.[/*]
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]Custom Spell Framework (custom_spells.json)[/b][/size]

Define complete custom spells in custom_spells.json (JSONC comments and trailing commas supported, validated by schemas/custom_spells.schema.json, with legacy custom_spells.txt fallback).

[b]Built-In Custom Spells[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Flames of Zamorak[/b] (ID: FlamesOfZamorak | Req. Level: Magic 20 | Rune Cost: 2× Fire) — Powered by DA_ZamorakStaff_Special with speed scaling and finisher clamp.[/*]
[*][b]Saradomin Strike[/b] (ID: SaradominStrike | Req. Level: Magic 30 | Rune Cost: 2× Air) — Line-of-sight chainstrike lightning barrage that scales strike count with Magic level, prioritizes unique nearby enemies, stuns targets, and scales with staff & Magic stats.[/*]
[*][b]Storm of Armadyl[/b] (ID: StormOfArmadyl | Req. Level: Magic 77 | Rune Cost: 2× Air) — Fires an Air Bolt with projectile impact tracking (trackImpact), erupting a windstorm AoE on impact with pushback, knockup, stun, and staff/Magic damage scaling.[/*]
[*][b]Saradomin Godsword[/b] (ID: SaradominGodsword | Rune Cost: 1× Air) — Spawns BP_Godsword_Special_Saradomin_C with the 2H Greatsword secondary montage and melee spin AoE hitbox.[/*]
[*][b]Saradomin Tempest[/b] (ID: SaradominTempest [i](disabled)[/i] | Rune Cost: 2× Air) — Reference template demonstrating layered multi-slot animations, ring-pattern VFX, GE_AddBurning, and target hit-react cues.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Timeline Cue Engine & Combat Effects[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Cue Types[/b]: anim, weaponAnim, targetAnim, vfx (Niagara with float/vector user parameters and point/ring/line/arc spawn patterns), sfx, actor, spell (with optional projectile trackImpact), hit, decal, shake, and chainstrike.[/*]
[*][b]Synchronization & Layering[/b]: Anchor cues with absolute timestamps (@0.35), simultaneous/synced starts (&, &id+0.15), or chained after-end triggers (>, >id-0.10), slot-layered montages (FullBody, LeftArm, RightArm, etc.), overlapPolicy (replace / parallel / ignore), stepAdvanceAt, and cancelOnRelease.[/*]
[*][b]Crowd Control & Hit Effects[/b]: hit and chainstrike cues support damage ranges, damage classes (Magical, Melee, Ranged), hit-reaction force, [b]Stun[/b] (with montage interrupt), [b]Root/Snare[/b], [b]Slow[/b] (multiplier + duration), [b]Pushback / Pull[/b], [b]Knockup (launchZ)[/b], and GameplayEffects (e.g., GE_AddBurning).[/*]
[*][b]Auto-Targeting & Target Lock-On[/b]: Respects active lock-on, reticle hover, and configurable crosshair-cone acquisition (AutoTargetMaxDistance, AutoTargetConeDeg, RequireLockOnForChainSpells, plus per-spell autoTarget overrides).[/*]
[/list]

[b]Progression Gating & Staff / Magic Damage Scaling[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Skill Level Gating (EnforceSpellLevelRequirements=true)[/b]: Checks requiredMagicLevel (or any requiredSkill) against native USkillComponent levels for both Quick-Cast and combo rules, displaying native in-game HUD notifications (UNotificationsSubsystem) when a player attempts to cast a locked spell.[/*]
[*][b]Dynamic Damage Scaling (EnableStaffDamageScaling=true)[/b]: Supports damageScaling modes (full, staff, magic, none) combining equipped staff tier, weapon damage multipliers, Masterwork bonus, per-staff keyword bonuses (staffBonus), Magic skill damage modifier, and live player Magic/Staff/Elemental attributes.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Companion Damage Bridge (.pak) & Runtime Safety[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Zero Vanilla Asset Overrides[/b]: All core gameplay patches run in Lua at runtime—patch-safe and compatible with .pak mods.[/*]
[*][b]Optional Companion ArcaneWildsDamageBridge_P.pak[/b]: Bundled in release archives (Content/Paks/~mods/), this tiny cooked Blueprint Function Library (/Game/Mods/ArcaneWilds/BFL_ArcaneWildsDamage) routes custom spell hits cleanly through native UDamageComponent::PredictDamage and UDamageFunctionLibrary::ApplyDamage for native damage floaties and hit reactions. If omitted, Arcane Wilds automatically falls back to direct Lua calls.[/*]
[*][b]Stability Guards[/b]: Executes all UObject/input/timeline logic on a single serialized Game-Thread tick (~40 Hz with watchdog recovery), validates UE asset classes before playing cues, and automatically clears casting tags, active timelines, and input blockers on player death, respawn, or pawn change.[/*]
[/list]

