[size=4][b]Arcane Wilds Studio (Visual Config Editor)[/b][/size]

Use [b]Arcane Wilds Studio[/b] to visually build and edit [b]Spell Combos[/b], [b]Custom Spells[/b], and [b]Quick-Cast Hotkeys[/b] without hand-editing JSON.

[list]
[*][b]Web Studio (GitHub Pages — no install required):[/b] [url=https://zolantris.github.io/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/]https://zolantris.github.io/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/[/url]
• Edit configs in your browser, then click [b]Export & Reveal[/b] (or [b]Bundle[/b]) and drop the exported user_*.json files into %LOCALAPPDATA%\ArcaneWilds\.
• Also publishes [url=https://zolantris.github.io/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/llms.txt]llms.txt[/url], JSON schemas, and the asset catalog so you can generate spells/combos with an AI assistant and paste them via [b]Import JSON[/b].[/*]
[*][b]Local Mode (1-click Save & live hot-reload):[/b] Double-click Launch-ArcaneWilds-Editor.bat inside ue4ss/Mods/ArcaneWilds/ (or run .\mod.ps1 editor arcane-wilds) to save directly to %LOCALAPPDATA%\ArcaneWilds\ and hot-reload changes in-game immediately.[/*]
[/list]

[quote][b]Full step-by-step tutorial:[/b] See [url=https://github.com/zolantris/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/blob/main/arcane-wilds/docs/studio-guide.md]docs/studio-guide.md[/url].[/quote]

