[size=4][b]Configuration, Mod Menu & Hot-Reload[/b][/size]

Most runtime settings can be edited live in-game via [b]Mod Menu[/b] (Esc > MODS > Arcane Wilds) or directly in ue4ss/Mods/ArcaneWilds/. Saving any editable file (Ctrl+S) [b]hot-reloads automatically in-game[/b]—and if a JSON syntax error is saved, Arcane Wilds keeps the previous valid rules/spells active and logs the error.

[list]
[*][b]config.txt[/b] — Core toggles, modifier key, Quick-Cast slots #1–#4, Freecast movement toggles, speed clamps, auto-targeting, staff scaling, progression gating, and debug flags.[/*]
[*][b]modmenu.json[/b] — Mod Menu UI schema exposing runtime settings under Esc > MODS.[/*]
[*][b]combo_rules.json[/b] — Active weighted combo chains (validated by schemas/combo_rules.schema.json; templates in combo_rules_examples.json).[/*]
[*][b]custom_spells.json[/b] — Custom spell definitions, requirements, scaling, and cue timelines (validated by schemas/custom_spells.schema.json).[/*]
[*][b]quick_cast.txt[/b] — Unlimited Quick-Cast spell & inline combo hotkey bindings.[/*]
[*][b]spell_names.txt[/b] — Friendly name-to-asset aliases (e.g., Air.slam = DA_Spell_Primary_Air_04, Ancient Magicks, Conjurer).[/*]
[*][b]detected_spells.txt / detected_vfx.txt[/b] — Auto-exported catalogs of loaded DominionSpellData assets, montages, and Niagara VFX paths (plus optional user-created vfx_names.txt aliases).[/*]
[/list]

[quote][b]Tip (Interactive Debug Hotkey & Inspection)[/b]: Set AllowDebugCommands=true and press SHIFT + BackSlash (\) in-game to force-reload configs, refresh detected_spells.txt / detected_vfx.txt, and log live staff/Magic scaling, lock status, InputBlocker state, and combo-to-asset bindings. Set DebugHotkey=LISTEN in config.txt to rebind interactively by pressing any key.[/quote]

[line]

[size=4][b]Installation & Multiplayer[/b][/size]

[b]Vortex (Recommended)[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download ArcaneWilds-vX.Y.Z.zip from Releases and drag it into Vortex.[/*]
[*]Enable and deploy (Vortex installs RSDragonwilds/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/ArcaneWilds/ and RSDragonwilds/Content/Paks/~mods/ArcaneWildsDamageBridge_P.pak).[/*]
[/list]

[b]Manual Installation[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Copy ue4ss/Mods/ArcaneWilds/ into <GameDir>/RSDragonwilds/Binaries/Win64/.[/*]
[*][i](Optional, recommended for custom spell damage/floaties)[/i] Copy ArcaneWildsDamageBridge_P.pak into <GameDir>/RSDragonwilds/Content/Paks/~mods/.[/*]
[*]Verify enabled.txt exists inside ue4ss/Mods/ArcaneWilds/.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Multiplayer[/b]
[list]
[*]Works client-side for Freecast and standard chaining.[/*]
[*]Recommend [b]Host + Clients[/b] both install Arcane Wilds (including ArcaneWildsDamageBridge_P.pak) when using high animation speed multipliers or custom timeline spells/VFX/SFX.[/*]
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b]Development, Building & Testing[/b][/size]

From the monorepo root:

[code]
# Validate JSON configs/schemas and run the offline Lua 5.4 test suite
.\mod.ps1 test arcane-wilds

# Build Vortex-ready archive (UE4SS Lua + ArcaneWildsDamageBridge_P.pak)
.\mod.ps1 build arcane-wilds

# Build without UE pak (Lua-only archive)
.\mod.ps1 build arcane-wilds -SkipPak

# Cleanly wipe and deploy ArcaneWilds to your game directory
.\mod.ps1 build-deploy arcane-wilds
[/code]

See [url=https://github.com/zolantris/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/blob/main/scripts/README.md]scripts/README.md[/url] and [url=https://github.com/zolantris/runescape-dragonwilds-mods/blob/main/unreal-engine/README.md]unreal-engine/README.md[/url] for packaging and Damage Bridge details.
